WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.585 --> 00:00:05.005
Could I get two glasses
of Tempranillo, please?

00:00:05.588 --> 00:00:09.009
It is very, very bad luck
to open a bottle of wine

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:10.218
and not finish it.

00:00:10.218 --> 00:00:11.553
Do you do this a lot?

00:00:11.553 --> 00:00:12.345
Do what?

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:14.806
Pick up sad and confused
women in the farthest

00:00:14.806 --> 00:00:16.182
reaches of Little Haiti.

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:18.852
Only ones as gorgeous
and interesting as you.

00:00:24.816 --> 00:00:26.109
I've got a lot
of things going on.

00:00:26.109 --> 00:00:27.444
I just want to
get to know you.

00:00:27.444 --> 00:00:29.487
I've been getting
these blackouts.

00:00:29.487 --> 00:00:32.782
I'm left with this really
strange sense of déjà vu.

00:00:32.782 --> 00:00:35.160
I keep seeing myself
die over and over.

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:37.078
You're safe.

00:00:37.078 --> 00:00:38.496
You're here with me.

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:45.879
It feels like I'm
not seeing all of you.

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:47.422
You know everything about me.

00:00:47.422 --> 00:00:48.256
Do I?

00:00:58.558 --> 00:01:01.561
We're definitely seeing an
acceleration of memory loss.

00:01:01.561 --> 00:01:04.022
I just think I can really help
you through this transition,

00:01:04.022 --> 00:01:04.814
sweetheart.

00:01:04.814 --> 00:01:07.108
What if I could give
you the perfect life

00:01:07.108 --> 00:01:08.276
that you always wanted?

00:01:08.276 --> 00:01:09.736
Wouldn't you want that?

00:01:09.736 --> 00:01:10.862
I need some time to think.

00:01:10.862 --> 00:01:13.114
I just hope you figure it
out before it's too late.

00:01:14.491 --> 00:01:15.867
She'll do anything to keep you.

00:01:15.867 --> 00:01:17.702
The blackouts.

00:01:17.702 --> 00:01:19.204
The headaches.

00:01:19.204 --> 00:01:20.538
They're only getting
worse, right?

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:25.502
I feel like I'm
losing my mind.

00:01:26.753 --> 00:01:28.129
Why would you do this?

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:30.423
Because we're
meant to be together.

00:01:35.512 --> 00:01:37.305
Next time, it's
going to be perfect.

